@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 165
skinparam ArrowColor #526C80
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #93AABC
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F5F8FA
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam nodesep 28
skinparam ranksep 30
rectangle "规划" as Plan
rectangle "模型" as Model #E6F1FC
rectangle "记忆" as Memory
rectangle "工具" as Tools
Model -left-> Plan : 拆解目标、调整步骤
Memory -down-> Model : 提供相关记录
Model -right-> Tools : 选择工具和参数
@enduml
